Package: pycnogrid
Title: Flexible Pycnophylactic Interpolation to Discrete Global and Local Grid Systems
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Christopher", "Higgins", , "cd.higgins@utoronto.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for pycnophylactic interpolation of polygon totals
    to discrete global and local grid systems while preserving mass.
